-- s 75(1): the person attains pensionable age on 1 January 2016. A day before it: outside the bar. On or after it, with an award made on or after it: barred (TRUE). With an award made before it: no bar (FALSE).
`s 75(1) test person` MEANS Person WITH
    `date of birth` IS Date 1 1 1950
    `sex` IS Man
    `marital status` IS `married`
    `date of attaining pensionable age` IS Date 1 1 2016
